ted their hearts. (The Revelations, therefore, do not move their hearts.)","roots_ordered":["ر ي ن","ق ل ب","ك و ن","ك س ب"],"tokens_ordered":["كلا","ران","قلوبهم","كانوا","يكسبون"],"vec_preview":[-0.015699999406933784,-0.007300000172108412,-0.010300000198185444,0.039500001817941666,-0.032499998807907104,-0.004600000102072954,-0.05310000106692314,-0.004699999932199717]},{"ayah_id":"83:15","surah":83,"ayah":15,"arabic":"كَلَّا إِنَّهُمْ عَن رَّبِّهِمْ يَوْمَئِذٍ لَّمَحْجُوبُونَ","english":"The truth is that they will be screened off (to deprive them of) the sight of their Lord.","roots_ordered":["ر ب ب","ح ج ب"],"tokens_ordered":["كلا","ربهم","يومءذ","لمحجوبون"],"vec_preview":[0.02500000037252903,0.12489999830722809,-0.01269999984651804,0.022600000724196434,0.005799999926239252,-0.008299999870359898,0.023800000548362732,-0.012400000356137753]},{"ayah_id":"83:16","surah":83,"ayah":16,"arabic":"ثُمَّ إِنَّهُمْ لَصَالُو الْجَحِيمِ","english":"Then they will be cast into Hell.","roots_ordered":["ص ل ي","ج ح م"],"tokens_ordered":["لصالو","الجحيم"],"vec_preview":[0.00989999994635582,0.04969999939203262,-0.011599999852478504,0.01510000042617321,0.02280000038444996,0.05180000141263008,-0.016899999231100082,-0.02759999968111515]},{"ayah_id":"83:17","surah":83,"ayah":17,"arabic":"ثُمَّ يُقَالُ هَـٰذَا الَّذِي كُنتُم بِهِ تُكَذِّبُونَ","english":"Then it will be said to them: ‘This is (the punishment of Hell) which you used to belie.’","roots_ordered":["ق و ل","ٱلَّذِى","ك و ن","ك ذ ب"],"tokens_ordered":["يقال","الذي","كنتم","به","تكذبون"],"vec_preview":[0.015200000256299973,0.04740000143647194,-0.0071000000461936,-0.0007999999797903001,-0.009200000204145908,-0.03240000084042549,0.04610000178217888,0.004900000058114529]},{"ayah_id":"83:18","surah":83,"ayah":18,"arabic":"كَلَّا إِنَّ كِتَابَ الْأَبْرَارِ لَفِي عِلِّيِّينَ","english":"This is (also) true that the record of the truly pious is for sure maintained in ‘Illiyyin (the ante-chamber of Paradise).","roots_ordered":["ك ت ب